  "text": "`(*Command).ResetCommands()` sets four fields to `nil` in `command.go:1277–1283`:\n\n- `c.parent`: the parent relationship.\n- `c.commands`: the child/subcommand list.\n- `c.helpCommand`: the help-command reference.\n- `c.parentsPflags`: the parent persistent-flags cache.\n\nIt does not reset `c.commandsAreSorted`, the sorting-state flag used by `Commands()` (`command.go:1292–1300`).",
